02:06:38.800 --> 02:06:41.570
from just walking actively.

02:06:41.570 --> 02:06:43.440
- So two to six minutes of-

02:06:43.440 --> 02:06:44.680
- Hard work.
- of hard work,

02:06:44.680 --> 02:06:47.090
with then an equivalent
